# 8 Sep 2026. Forward from ab93328169fc. Diffed as a parsed schema tree rather
# than as text, because the last defects on this document were YAML that parsed
# cleanly into the wrong place (yuvoy-api#92, #103). PURELY ADDITIVE: 126 lines
# added, and the only removals are two `required:` lists that GREW — `bookable`
# joined `Experience` and `AvailabilityPage`. Nothing removed, nothing retyped.
#
# Consumed in this change:
#   - `Experience.bookable` and `AvailabilityPage.bookable` (yuvoy-app#19) —
#     one eligibility predicate now governs every sale. Deliberately NOT a 404:
#     the card is already gone from every feed and from search, so the only way
#     to this page is a link, a bookmark or a search result, and telling that
#     person the business does not exist is worse than telling them it is not
#     selling. It carries NO reason, and will not — why a business stopped
#     selling is a supply judgement about them.
#   - `pricingUnit` / `pricingUnitLabel` (yuvoy-app#20 §1) — the fix for a
#     consumer pricing misstatement. Both screens hard-coded "per person" next
#     to the price, and the platform has always supported group pricing, so a
#     ₹12,000 charter for six read as ₹12,000 per person with our authority
#     behind it. The LABEL is rendered verbatim, never mapped, so the phrase
#     cannot drift between the card, the detail page and the operator portal.
#   - `activityType` / `activityTypeLabel` (yuvoy-app#20 §2) — the twelve
#     categories are market-agnostic, so in the Andamans every water sport is
#     `adventure`. Optional: absent on a listing nobody has classified.
